bounty-description-salvage-raw-xeno-meat = A modern day Iron Chef has requested unique proteins to create a new star dish with. Let's send them some of the best we can find!
bounty-description-salvage-abyssium-ore = We heard of the existance of some Abyssium ore in the sector. Our team wants you to retrieve some for testing.
bounty-description-salvage-old-treasure = We have a collector of some antiquated technologies willing to pay handsomely for some old relic technology, see what you can find for them.
bounty-description-salvage-space-bear-hide = We have a new rug merchant in dire need of exquisite materials. A raw space bear hide should interest them, go get it salvagers.
bounty-description-salvage-bandolier = We have a certain collector of USSP merchandise, they wish to finish their cosplay outfit, and have requested a few bandoliers. Get it done.
bounty-description-salvage-commie-id = Again, this certain collector of USSP merchandise is really going out down to the ID Card, let's get them a few to get their LARP on fleek.
bounty-description-salvage-vodkizine = The board of directors demand a quality drink to toast with during their next quarterly reports meeting, make sure you dont spill it!
bounty-description-salvage-akms = We've been contracted to acquire high powered soviet weapons for a less-than-legal operation. Don't ask questions, just get the guns.
bounty-description-salvage-reactor = A local militant cell is paying top credit for expedition reactors, don't dissapoint them.
bounty-description-salvage-dragon = Our Iron Chef is requesting a more exotic cut of meat than normal Xeno's can supply, don't let it bite you first.
bounty-description-salvage-cloning = Loss Prevention needs cloning components to replace a client who recently disapeared.
bounty-description-salvage-keg = The Annual cost cutting meeting is soon, and they need a proper drink supply.
bounty-description-salvage-weapons = Research data on the Finka, Makarov, and Mosin recently were all mysteriously destroyed. Grab some samples so we can get that information back.
bounty-description-salvage-mop = ITG's custodial team has been overwhelmed by the surge in messes on ATS's and shuttles, either stop being slobs or grab them a mop!
bounty-description-salvage-protolathe = a local Vulcan production center is missing a core piece of tech to be able to produce more modkits. Help them help us!

